From 2c332629427f06073940f10e7380c0d2f6ac665e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:45:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bases round 2 (not yet rendered): night blacks lifted,
 lean-to, generator, Bot Bay and signal tower remodelled, lantern shaft,
 planters, far-base quay

Night: quay joints, tie rings, cracks, tyre marks and occlusion floor lifted; puddles keep a
little sky; kit hazard black, rubber and the stacked grime/occlusion multiply get a floor.
Models: riveted H-posts, I-beams, corrugated sheets, patches, hoses, hinged covers, a chain
hoist, a caged ladder; new tech bolted on, dark until powered. Colliders, anchors, node names
and state hooks unchanged. Far bases stand on a generic 1024 px set of the quay maps.
Headless only so far: 10/10 own tests, one built-yard game run without script errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RfzdfG5ndbW1K3y1fxfznF
